Third-party material
--------------------

models/dentalsegmentator/ (weights.*.bin, model.json, model.js, source/)
  DentalSegmentator pretrained model
  Gauthier Dot et al. Zenodo record 10829675, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10829675
  Dot G. et al. DentalSegmentator: robust open source deep learning-based CT and
  CBCT image segmentation. Journal of Dentistry (2024).
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jdent.2024.105130
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Changes: the published PyTorch float32 checkpoint (SHA-256
  a3a91ae0f8d7ab403d8662e47d2f0bdf7fc51e7783b46632841274dff8266c32) was converted
  to float16 shards; the learned values were not otherwise modified. The
  preprocessing parameters (source/plans.json, source/dataset.json) are those of
  the SlicerDentalSegmentator Dataset111_453CT v1.0.0-alpha release
  (https://github.com/gaudot/SlicerDentalSegmentator), whose checkpoint is
  byte-identical to the one in the Zenodo archive.
  The original authors do not endorse this application.

